# Evergreen docs and comments

- Write only decisions and facts. No references to conversations, "we", or step-by-step chat context.
- Prefer short, actionable text. Omit explanatory fluff.
- In tables or specs: state the decision (e.g. "JSON preferred; accept text/plain") without extra rationale in the doc.
